  "joint_inequality": "D=EG exp(-rho*tau)J, C=EG sum_learning exp(-rho*T_i) X_i. Complete equity NPV<=b*D-ds*C; for D>=alpha, kl(D,alpha)<=I*C. Actual completed learning capture per certificate additionally gives C>=D pathwise after discounting. For D<alpha use information lower0. No change of unknown market after history.",
  "ordinary_bound": "K*log(1-alpha+alpha*exp(b/K)); K=ds/I_upper is conservative. Post-certification potential x+h(x) valid in this same point-good market for all cash/business controls.",
  "qualified_bound": "sup_D bD-ds*max(D,kl_positive(D,alpha)/I_upper). On listed rates b>ds and derivative at crossing<0, so maximum occurs at D_cross; safe upper=(b-ds)*D_cross_upper.",
  "market_and_cash_proof": "Point G=delta_lambda and Q=delta_ell each legal. Under G/Q, completed original window success probabilities1-exp(-lambda*q),1-exp(-ell*q). Truncated exponential KL per G capture <=log(lambda/ell)-1+ell/lambda; binary coarsening and stopping with independent Exp(rho) give discounted information bound. Post cash h from A56/A57 rechecked only for active/idle/dividend inequalities. Pre-capture H is not imported into ordinary class; mixed-speed G from A34 is not combined with point-good cash.",
